{"id":"neplokho","lemma":"неплохо","pos":"adv","rank":409,"glosses":["not badly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bd/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BF%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%85%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BF%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%85%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Неплохо.","en":"It's not bad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/196982","words":[null]},{"text":"Твоя идея звучит неплохо.","en":"Your idea doesn't sound bad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/651045","words":[{"g":"your","l":"твой"},{"g":"idea, thought, notion"},null,null]},{"text":"У тебя это неплохо получается.","en":"You're not bad at this.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,null]},{"text":"\"Как дела?\" - \"Неплохо\".","en":"\"How are you?\" \"Not bad.\"","words":[null,null,null],"phrases":[[0,2,"how are you?"]]},{"text":"Было бы неплохо это сделать.","en":"It would be good to do that.","words":[{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"would"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do"}]}]}